citations.review_text:
Fantastic game, loved every second of it... well, maybe not beating the game on Hard Mode but that's a side thing.

Gameplay;
its great, difficult as hell but whenever you get it down it feels so rewarding to flawlessly clear out a room, learning curve? absolutely.
Story;
Intricate, love it. I may not understand every side of it, given the story isn't finished yet (DLC Tomorrow WE JUST GOTTA BELIEVE.) but from the parts I did understand, alongside some slight theories. I loved it.
Music;
Great, the tracks for the combat parts of levels are great, but I especially have an appreciation for the calmer songs, I dunno man. the songs kinda make those moments, not to say they'd be bad without the music. but it adds emotion to a lot of scenes that wouldn't hit the same without the music.
Extra;
Shout-out to the devs for being extremely adamant the DLC will be free, even after working on it for multiple years since I'd be willing to pay at this point, seriously respect to that.
Well that's the review wrapped up, seriously play this game, it's great. go in blind if you haven't been spoiled on anything before.
I recommend this game HEAVILY.
